  clock: 2  # 0dc6
  nonce: 0dc6  # 0dc6
  message: "WI-palol merged via PR #3915 (commit 659c575645). Closes the structural-fix half of the INV's recurrence pattern: workspace-scoped imports (cohorts 1+4 of the closure spec) now flow through a generic promote phase rather than per-ecosystem targeted patches. Cohorts 2+3 (bakerydemo Django bare-name, chatwoot Rails autoload-with-no-imports) remain unaddressed — bare-name promotion would need a different mechanism (count threshold, per-language whitelist, or distinct compound-import-required gate; the design tension is unresolved). INV-rojip stays violated until a follow-on WI extends promote to those cases AND a bakeoff confirms the four cohorts. Suggested next: file the bare-name extension as a separate WI; run the bakeoff for WI-palol on apollo-server+Node-monorepo cohort first to validate the scoped path lands cleanly."  # 0dc6
- op: discuss  # e8c4
  at: '2026-05-26T18:11:23Z'  # e8c4
  by: agent  # e8c4
  actor: jgstern_agent  # e8c4
  clock: 3  # e8c4
  nonce: e8c4  # e8c4
  message: "Filed WI-pusad (WI-pusad-hunaj-pafuk-halud-sugul-tulub-labuk-vojin) as the bare-name extension to WI-palol. Implements Mechanism B (compound-import-required gate): bare-name patterns promote only when at least one prod-non-test importer matched via the prefix arm of _module_matches (compound submodule like django.db or rails/generators), not on bare-exact imports alone. Preserves WI-rofiz lesson (bare 'import graphql' for typedef installs still doesn't promote). Closes cohorts 2 (bakerydemo Django) and 3 partial (chatwoot Rails with Gemfile declaration — Rails-without-Gemfile remains out of scope; that variant needs a file-structure heuristic, separate mechanism class). isbefore link added: INV-rojip stays violated until both WI-palol AND WI-pusad bakeoffs land and confirm no regression."  # e8c4
- op: discuss  # 6bd2
  at: '2026-05-26T18:17:37Z'  # 6bd2
  by: agent  # 6bd2
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 6bd2
  clock: 4  # 6bd2
  nonce: 6bd2  # 6bd2
  message: "Filed INV-fomod (INV-fomod-gonit-kojim-rohag-sozif-lanoh-kazah-jatun, P4 violated) as a sibling class for the chatwoot Rails-autoload-no-imports residue and similar autoload-by-convention cases where manifest is silent AND no import edges exist. Distinct mechanism class (file-structure signatures), not a refinement of INV-rojip's import-edge approach. INV-rojip stays scoped to import-edge promotion; INV-fomod is the file-structure complement. The two together cover all three detection paths (manifest / import-edge / file-structure). INV-fomod NOT linked isbefore INV-rojip — they're orthogonal closure paths."  # 6bd2
