  message: "WI-palol (PR #3915) + WI-pusad (PR #3917) shipped. Cohorts 1+4 (workspace-scoped imports) handled by WI-palol; cohorts 2+3 partial — bakerydemo Django bare-name handled by WI-pusad. Cohort 3 chatwoot Rails-without-Gemfile case explicitly out of scope (file-structure heuristic; INV-fomod is the orthogonal sibling for that). Bakeoff on 7 cases (3 synthetic positive, 1 synthetic regression, 3 real) confirmed: django source, flask-restful, hypergumbo-self all behave as expected (Django + Flask promoted from imports, hypergumbo self produces zero FPs). Transitions violated → pending_validation pending the BROAD cycle that confirms cohorts hold across the prospector corpus."  # bb45
